OL,3,APrince William joins other royalty at
OL,4,Afuneral of Norway's King Harald V as
OL,5,Acrowds line streets
OL,6,
OL,7,FA funeral service is being held for
OL,8,FKing Harald V, with the Prince of Wales
OL,9,Fand other European royals in attendance
OL,10,F- watch live coverage above
OL,12,FTens of thousands of people are lining
OL,13,Fthe streets of Norway's capital Oslo to
OL,14,Fpay their respects after 13 days of
OL,15,Fnational mourning
OL,17,FThe late monarch died in August after
OL,18,F35 years on the throne - his son,
OL,19,FHaakon VIII, has succeeded him
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
